<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela bolivar firms as CenBank weighs in.</title>
<headline>Venezuela bolivar firms as CenBank weighs in.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan bolivar closed firm at 479.25/480.25 per dollar after heavy Central Bank dollars sales into a thin market, traders said.</p>
<p>The bolivar closed Monday at 479.50/480.50 per dollar.</p>
<p>Central Bank intervention &quot;was strong. It inundated the market with dollars throughout the whole day, but especially in the afternoon,&quot; said one trader.</p>
<p>((--Silene Ramirez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
